{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "162", "x": 0.8959551137550246, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03778813484861114, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Rosie: Colin, I'm really struggling to think of a topic for our human geography", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8267280350282656, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "assignment.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.13368487602118698, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Colin: Me too, Rosie. I'll tell you what, let's think about the different aspects of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.8259905730355476, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "human geography and see if we can narrow the topic down a bit to help us decide.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8375416494809212, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Rosie: Okay. So, one aspect is population. That would be all about population", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8266578054349093, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "density and migration and so on. Lots of facts and statistics. Maybe a bit boring.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.8224237298926779, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Colin: I thought that had been taken off the syllabus for this year.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.6786690835899276, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Rosie: Has it? Colin: I'm not sure, but it might be best to avoid it.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.6607291646482066, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Rosie: Okay. Maybe we could do something on culture. We had that lecture about", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.8262044400891844, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "culture and geography last week. I didn't get much out of that. It was also general", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.8262080284625676, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and the lecturer didn't give any useful examples.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.5101043211909955, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Colin: Yeah, I hardly took any notes. It didn't seem worth it.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.609529791854864, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Rosie: Me neither.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.19904468785918977, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Colin: We could focus on poverty. That's something that's a global problem.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.7822772135316945, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Rosie: The trouble is Dr. Lee was saying that you have to be careful with some of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.8257422575974322, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "the figures relating to poverty. They're sometimes deliberately manipulated.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5480641079592289, "w": 0.788929135059505, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Colin: Things like theft and robbery.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.38025815885893005, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Rosie: Yes, but where I come from, that's linked to another more serious issue,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.8260540359819527, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "which is that a lot of people don't have jobs. That's getting worse and worse. And", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.825837503279517, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "we also still have quite a lot of people who are homeless, though that's not quite", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.8263893951058483, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "so bad as it was.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.18085278821225495, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Colin: It would be nice to talk about some positive developments, like some of the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.8260592647545968, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "new developments on the outskirts of cities.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7462654689772478, "w": 0.46313794742786935, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Rosie: Yeah, they've opened some massive new shopping centers outside my city.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7745958190513854, "w": 0.8375416494809212, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Colin: Yeah, the same with mine. But it's meant a lot of the shops in the city center", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8029261691255231, "w": 0.8261408746178254, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "are closing down, but the outskirts are ideal for buildings that need a lot of space,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8312565191996607, "w": 0.8262077208877061, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "like for conferences. They've opened a couple of big ones.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8596116899500704, "w": 0.6028779215895305, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Rosie: Yes, we've got some, too. It'd be nicer to have more facilities for things like", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8879420400242081, "w": 0.8261390291686569, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "football, too, but that's not happening where I live.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9162723900983457, "w": 0.5248190613984014, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}